Dear {{ applicant_name }},

Re: {{ grant }}, {{ round_name }} round
Project: {{ project_title }} (application {{ application_id }})

{% if outcome == "approve" -%}
We are pleased to tell you that your application meets the eligibility rules for this grant.
{%- elif outcome == "reject" -%}
We have assessed your application and it does not meet some of the eligibility rules for this grant.
Each reason is listed below with the rule it comes from, so you can check it and tell us if you think we got it wrong.
{%- elif outcome == "clarify" -%}
We have assessed your application and need more information before we can make a decision.
This is not a rejection. Please reply with the information listed below.
{%- else -%}
Your application is still being assessed by a grants officer. We will contact you when a decision is made.
{%- endif %}
{% for r in reasons %}
{{ loop.index }}. {{ r.text }}
   Rule {{ r.rule_id }}: {{ r.source }}
{%- if r.officer_note %}
   Officer's note: {{ r.officer_note }}
{%- endif %}
{% endfor -%}
{% if final_note %}
{{ final_note }}
{% endif -%}
{% if outcome in ("reject", "clarify") %}
If you think any of these reasons is wrong, reply to this letter and quote the rule number. A grants officer, not a computer, will review your response.
{% endif %}
Yours sincerely,
{{ officer }}
Grants Officer
